{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14226490.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226490","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226490","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1422649001:0":{"text":"あ、ブライアン！お願い、助けて！","source_cn":"是布莱恩！快来帮帮忙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7110D2C672D55FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:拉莉洁":{"text":"ラリジェ","source":"拉莉洁","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14226500.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226500","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226500","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422650001:1":{"text":"今年は保管場所が限られてるから、お供え物は減らすか他のにしてくれって言ったじゃないですか！これじゃ入りきらないし、もうめちゃくちゃですよ！","source_cn":"我都说了，今年的仓库有限，贡品需要减量和替换。现在这样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8515667FA5AE2AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422650002:1":{"text":"ちゃんと減らしたさ。けど、傷んだらすぐに補充できるよう、予備のお供え物も必要だろう？","source_cn":"已经减过量了，况且贡品必须留一些备用，否则坏掉就来不及...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAA88068F2AAF2B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422650003:1":{"text":"倉庫に入りきらないんじゃ、予備もろとも傷んじゃうでしょう！","source_cn":"塞不进仓库，你的备用品也要坏掉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23EF3C305B4F314D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422650004:1":{"text":"どうしたんだ？","source_cn":"什么情况？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEBB6389CF71CB0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422650005:1":{"text":"ブライアン！ちょっと聞いてよ！入れ替えしやすいように、倉庫には余裕を持たせろって、ライカたちが言ってたでしょ？","source_cn":"布莱恩！你快来评评理！之前是莱卡她们提出的，仓库要留出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94E53DB55E2B0940","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422650006:1":{"text":"だから、一回に運び込むお供え物の数を減らすようにって、要望書にもそう書いたのよ。","source_cn":"所以单次收入的贡品量都要减少，我给出的需求单都已经是修...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x537CD3536F29CE61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422650007:1":{"text":"なのに、サンリン様ったら、結局大量に用意しちゃって、全然入りきらないの！","source_cn":"但是桑琳大人那边准备的贡品还是太多啦，根本没办法收纳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE35AE2FE71C1096","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422650008:1":{"text":"要望書通りに数は減らしてあるじゃないか。それに、これは祝祷用のお供え物なんだよ。","source_cn":"我已经根据需求减过量了，但是祈福所需要贡品也不可能减太多！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA7C7F1B8DE9F04B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","doc